<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37819" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπάγγ-ελμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>promise, profession,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.178
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Πρωταγόρου ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1402a25
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				319a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ μεγέθους τοῦ ἐ. οὐδὲν
					θαυμαστὸν ἀπιστεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Euthd.</u>
					274a
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Metrod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.88S.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαγγέλματι,</span> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἀλήθειαν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.182
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>subject</i> of a treatise, that which it <i>purports</i> to
			contain, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. τοῦ συγγράμματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>Tact.Praef.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαγγελία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Crito
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.878
			</span></i>, Id. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				15.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>art, profession,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐ. τῆς ἀοτοποιΐας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					M.Ant.
					3.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
